# Mobile Hero Image Placeholder

This file represents an optimized WebP image for mobile devices.

In a production environment, this would be:
- A WebP format image (smaller file size)
- Optimized dimensions: 768x1024px (mobile portrait)
- Compressed for fast loading
- Generated from your existing hero video thumbnail

To create this file:
1. Take a frame from your hero video or use an existing hero image
2. Resize to 768x1024px for mobile portrait orientation
3. Convert to WebP format using tools like:
   - Online converters (squoosh.app, cloudconvert.com)
   - Command line: `cwebp input.jpg -o hero-mobile.webp -q 80`
   - Image editing software with WebP export

This optimized mobile image will significantly reduce load times on mobile devices.